window.products.push({"id":323124,"name":"WSTECHCO DIY Desktop Shelf Adjustable Bookcase Organizer Shelves,Sturdy Durable Books Storage Rack Office Countertop Storage Rack Freestyle with 2 Org","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qeIvgx3LL._AC_.jpg","description":"The multiple compartments allow for storage of different types of items like textbooks or notebooks, a pencil cup, and some other papers etc. The bottom provides a nice area to place mail or incoming paperwork. It looks professional and yet adds a lot of personality to your otherwise drab work area  It can be used to store small books, magazine,toys or small decorations, cosmetics or other stuffs. Perfect size that can suitable for multiple places,such as living room, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen and office etc   A Great Addition to your Home Office  This desktop storage organizer will make a fine addition to any home office, bedroom, sewing room, or the like.It looks beautiful in the room on top of your white nightstand,and the filigree work on the sides is pretty enough for any girl's room  Such a adorable desktop bookshelf comes in handy next to your bed when you want to read a book or need to find the remote control,make your nightstand looks much better being organized. Anyone who is looking for help organizing books, desktop items, cosmetics and more,this organizing shelf will work in practically any room in the house   Although a sheet of pictorial instruction attached,the little bookshelf is easy to follow. Kids will enjoy the assembly because there're no tools,screws or nails involved,there are notches and the pieces fit together like one of those 3D puzzles  The notches all fit together tightly and are very snug and secure once in place.You can use the flat of your palm to hammer them together or use a rubber mallet to lightly tap in some pieces  Here one tip you should know: Have to double-check to be sure you had the right pieces before locking them together,once they're locked,it may be hard to pull them apart","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qeIvgx3LL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WSTECHCO","source_asin":"B07H4J2G64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-323124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H4J2G64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H4J2G64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
