window.products.push({"id":323357,"name":"Sweet 11th Birthday Balloon 11th Birthday Decorations Happy 11th Birthday Party Supplies Purple Number 11 Foil Mylar Balloons Latex Balloon Gifts for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VZf3dKatS._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Sweet 11th Birthday Balloon 11th Birthday Decorations Happy 11th Birthday Party Supplies Purple Number 11 Foil Mylar Balloons Latex Balloon Gifts for Girls,Boys,Women,Men Do you want an elegant Purple number 11 balloon for celebrating your birthday? Organizing a classy and luxurious-look 11 Purple balloons and decorations? Happy birthday! Congratulations on your birthday, we want to host a wonderful birthday party for you. You can decorate your party easily Light up the event with this Purple helium balloons numbers decorations supplies kit. Make your party event a big hit with a classy themed party! All our confetti balloons are pre-filled and ready to use. The aluminum foil balloons are auto-seal. Simply tape It or use the ribbon to hang the HAPPY BIRTHDAY banner on the ceiling, wall, window or even in the courtyard to create a spectacular visual effect for your guests. Inflation Instructions: Inflate with helium or air. Wipe the inflated balloon with paper, wool, or carpet so that the confetti can hold the balloon tightly.If you use air, they will not float.Low-quality helium is not enough to make the balloon float Material: Mylar foil balloons Color: Purple Package Includes: 40 Inch Purple foil balloons \"11\" set 16 inch \"HAPPY BIRTHDAY DAY\" banner balloons 4pcs 18 inch mylar loving heart balloons 10 pcs confetti balloons 5pcs Purple latex balloons 5pcs pink latex balloons 5pcs white latex balloons Seller Warranty: We will do our best to provide the best pre-sales and after-sales services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VZf3dKatS._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WXLWXZ","source_asin":"B093BYP3ST","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-323357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093BYP3ST","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093BYP3ST","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":323358,"name":"KitchenAid 8-1/2-by-10/-1/2-Inch Poly Paddle Board, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31K0WKP1RFL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Hold it! Cutting and preparing ingredients for your cooking recipes have just got easier. This paddle shaped cutting board is easy to hold. It's also easy to clean, totally neutral so it doesn't influence taste, and nonslip for added stability. Amazon.com The KitchenAid 8-1/2 by 10-1/2 inch cutting board is a solid, useful cook's tool that looks great too. You wouldn't think a cutting board could really have a look, but this one does. It's a curved rectangle of paddle-shaped, heavy-duty, white plastic accented with Santoprene, a heat-resistant rubber. The KitchenAid logo is displayed on a silver-toned inset in the handle. Frequent cooks will appreciate the advantage of having several cutting boards to choose from. For instance, it's better to have one reserved solely for onions and garlic, so those flavors don't transfer to other foods waiting to be chopped. Instead of dirtying extra bowls and plates, place food on a cutting board for a minute or two until the water's boiling or the pan is heated. The cutting surface of this board--8-1/2 by 10-1/2 inches--large enough to handle most chopping or slicing jobs, and small enough to carry from counter to stovetop. Plastic cutting boards are gentler on knives than glass, easier to sterilize than woodthey're not sensitive to bleach solutions like some woodsand can be washed in the dishwasher. Staining may occur, especially with high-color fruit and vegetable juices like beet and pomegranate, but this will not affect the performance of the board. This KitchenAid cutting board measures 8-1/2 by 10-1/2 inches (15-3/4 long with handle) and is 1/2 inch thick. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31K0WKP1RFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B0000CDBWD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-323358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CDBWD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CDBWD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
