window.products.push({"id":323453,"name":"Glass Cups Bamboo Lids for Beer Can Glass 16oz, Drinking Glasses Beer Can Glasses Set of 6, Iced Coffee Cups, Beer Glass Cups, Beer Can Glass with Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t3ZHB4CJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rich Accessories: Our 16oz/480ml glass cups with lids and straws includes 6 pcs 16 oz can shaped glass cups (3 inch diameter x 5. 25 Inch height), 6 pcs lids with hole, 6 pcs glass straws, 2 pcs brushes. Beautiful and Durable: Compared with ordinary beer can glass, our beer can glass with lids and straw use the high-quality durable clear glass (high borosilicate), so more clear, smooth and sturdy, also withstand temperature and dishwasher safe. Widely Use Glass Cup Set: Our glass cups set is great for anyone, any drinks and any occasion. You can use glass cup set for beer glass can, iced coffee glass cups, soda can glasses cups, iced tea glasses cups,water,whiskey,juices,cocktails, widely loved by family, party, picnic, cafes, bars and restaurants. If you want to decorate the glass cup, you can do DIY easily and conveient without breakage. An Amazing Gift: Try to send our beer can glass with lids and straw to your friend or family. Whether it is Christmas, Father's Day, Anniversary, Wedding, Bachelorette Parties, Birthday gift, or any given occasion, surprise your beloved ones and they will love the glass cups to no end. 100% Satisfactory Service: Our glass cup with bamboo lid and straw had been carefully and safely packaged, but accidents are inevitable in the transportation of glass products.So if the glass cups you received was imperfect, or you are not 100% satisfied for other, please contact us at first, we will still help you and offer a satisfactory solution as soon as possible. Special reminder: We have recently updated our product packaging to provide safer service and better-looking packaging（as shown in our video）. Our 4-piece glass cups have all been replaced，however, our 6-piece beer can glass still has some old packaging in the Amazon warehouse, thanks for our customer understanding. Have a nice day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t3ZHB4CJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANGBI","source_asin":"B0B2F1QNJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-323453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2F1QNJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2F1QNJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
