window.products.push({"id":323510,"name":"HONGJING Stainless Steel Boat Capacity Full Heavy Walled Keep Gravy and Sauces Hot, 18 oz.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ND8fwA0IL._AC_.jpg","description":"Features: Name: Stainless steel leak proof gravy boat material: Top 304 stainless steel, never rust, environmental health capacity:550ml/18oz net weight:450g product size: Diameter 8. 5cm x height 14. 8cm descriptions: 100% brand new and high quality. Food grade stainless steel oil. Body crafted by brushed stainless steel, easy clean and hygienic. Back flow prevention spout design, better control of oil, to give you a healthy lifestyle. Can hold edible oil, sauce, vinegar etc. Suitable for home or restaurant kitchen use. This stylish stainless steel gravy boat will guaranteed to impress your guests at the dinner table, whether it's for a small dinner party or for a family meal. Featuring a double insulated wall, the HONGJING double insulated gravy boat will ensure your gravy or sauce is kept at a hot temperature for longer compared to traditional gravy boats/jugs. The hinged lid helps to reduce heat-loss and features a lever hinge for ease of use and making re-filling easier. It also features a wide spout to ensure liquids have a smooth flow when pouring as well as a strong curved handle for ease of grip. It is also dishwasher safe so it makes washing up a lot easier this jug is ideal for any types of sauces or liquids such as food oil, gravy, custard, cream and milk. Vacuum pot with screw stopper (plastic) with quick stop pouring system for one hand use, large opening insulating plastic handle. The exclusive product line for each stylish laid table at home or in the office, double-walled stainless steel cups, the coffee pots vacuum keep coffee or tea hot for hours. Big enough to serve the entire family. Insulated gravy boat makes it perfect for small dinner parties or traditional Sunday family meal. Easy to use thumb operated lid results in smooth pouring non-drip spout.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ND8fwA0IL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HONGJING","source_asin":"B01N6JN9L9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-323510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N6JN9L9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N6JN9L9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
