window.products.push({"id":323811,"name":"puredown® Natural Goose Down Feather Pillows for Sleeping Oval Gusseted Down Feather Pillow 100% Cotton Pillow Cover with Leaf Quilting Queen Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a6KY-OjJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐ 3 SIZES OPTIONS - Our down and feather pillows come in a variety of sizes, mostly to match bed sizes. They are available in 3 sizes as follows: Standard: 20 x 26”, Queen: 20 x 30”, King 20 x 36”. 🌼 DOWN AND FEATHER BLEND FILLING - A 5% goose down and 95% goose feather blend filling makes Puredown pillow stay fluffy and firm. These Pillows are perfect for anyone searching for medium support for their neck and shoulders. 🌙 ERGONOMIC DESIGN GUSSET - The ergonomic oval gusset side ensures the pillow holds its shape. It offers you a balance of softness and firmness, providing gentle support and maximum comfort for your head and neck. 🦢 ETHICALLY-SOURCED DOWN - All of our pillows follow the Responsible Down Standard (RDS). The stuffing of down and feather is carefully selected from premium and reliable raw materials which are easily bounced back to their original fluffiness and the pillow could hug your head, with a lightweight-yet-supportive feel. 💧 WASH INSTRUCTION - Machine washes cold separately gentle cycle, tumble dry low. Keep feather pillows as dry as possible. Sleeping on a feather and down pillow with wet hair is not recommended. Washable pillowcases are recommended to keep the pillow clean and extend its lifetime use. Fluffing your pillows daily by tapping or squeezing can help them return to their normal shape and force the inside air making the pillows fluffy again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a6KY-OjJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"puredown","source_asin":"B07RSJBZXK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-323811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RSJBZXK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RSJBZXK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
