window.products.push({"id":323847,"name":"Violet Linen Prestige Damask Design Tablecloth White 60\" by 162\" Oblong/Rectangle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811zmUW51-L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Violet Linen Inc. was founded in 1996 and established in the beginning of 1997. Violet Linen's mission is to preserve the look and touch of many generations back \"Grandma's magnificent tablecloth,\" while focusing at the same time on easy care, durability and at very aggressive pricing, and they are proud to have accomplished their goals and objectives well beyond their expectations and have ever since enjoyed a sterling reputation among their thousands of customers. Prestige Medallion Damask Pattern in a variety of great colors The Prestige Medallion Damask Pattern tablecloths are expertly tailored, Fabric is made from 100% Polyester Microfiber for ultra soft feel and easy care. The tablecloth from our Exclusive Prestige Medallion Damask Pattern collection transforms any tabletop into a visual masterpiece. The modern and trendy tablecloth is a wonderful accessory to any table or buffet server and is also perfect for special events or parties such as wedding reception tables, bridal showers, birthday parties, anniversary and many other special events. Decorate your home with richness and style with this tablecloth, and augment the unique style of your room in an instant! Having this custom tablecloth will add a touch of delight to your home decor, and will bring new life to your home. The tablecloth is sure to add flavor, texture, and depth to your living space. • Soft luxuries decoration for an affordable price. • Simple to clean and machine wash, Easily laundered 100% polyester material. • Attractive, intricate Lace detailed design for a premium appearance. • Elegant tailoring and expertly sewn hems. • Fade-resistant and Stain-resistant. • Seamless, one piece construction without joins and stitching. • Machine wash on cold, Tumble dry on low. Specifications: Material: 100 % Polyester.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811zmUW51-L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Violet Linen","source_asin":"B0BYBV9PTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-323847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYBV9PTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYBV9PTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":323848,"name":"Travel Bartender Kit Bag | Professional 17-piece Silver Bar Tool Set with Portable Bar Bag and Shoulder Strap for Easy Carry and Storage | Best Travel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.71,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A12+ddKA51S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Everything You Need (Except For The Booze) » 17-Piece ALL-INCLUSIVE bartending kit of top shelf bar accessories and a stylish carry-on bartender roll. Will give you the power to whip up impressive cocktails for your guests. Whether you're an amateur bartender or a drink mixing guru, whether you’re setting up a bar at home or at work - Our portable cocktail mixer set is a brilliant way to hit the ground running. Carry Your Tools Like A Boss » Hand-crafted rustic-style bartender tote bag, carefully designed with extra inner straps and compartments to keep your Boston shaker and other barware tools organized and accessible at all times -> With 27 different pockets and fixed straps, you can fit any tools combination or even carry your liquor bottle. Wear your bag with style and comfort, carry it by the handle or with the attached shoulder strap. Impressive Gift For Cocktail Lovers: First-class mixology kit plus a stylish canvas bar bag, both packed together inside a classy gift box. Whether it's an anniversary, wedding, Christmas, Father's day or any other occasion, your recipient will be thrilled like a child in a candy store. The one gift they'll surely cherish. Plus, to make things truly delicious, we’ll throw in a Lewis ice bag for an icy experience. Solid And Durable: Heavy-duty and high-grade bar accessories packed in a reinforced canvas bag with sturdy full-grain leather straps and steel buckles. This entire travel cocktail shaker set is made of the best materials and have been carefully tested by our top mixologists. Worry not, the bag is laundry compatible, the bar tool are recommended to wash by hand to avoid scratching the surfaces. Treat them well and forget about wear and tear with this bar kit bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A12+ddKA51S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mixology & Craft","source_asin":"B08CL1PS7X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-323848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CL1PS7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CL1PS7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
