window.products.push({"id":323865,"name":"Piffny 24 Inch Glass Cooktop Cleaner Scraper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qE1KDwm1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why spend countless dollars on chemicals for your cooktop? Why waste time and energy applying those chemicals, waiting for them to work, and then having to scrub anyway? Save all that effort for your deep cleaning. With StoveRazor, you can help keep your glass cooktop clean on a daily basis with hardly any hassle! USING THE STOVERAZOR IS EASY: ● Hold the StoveRazor with the glass scraper blade at a 45 degree angle to the glass stovetop. ● Press down firmly and swipe away from you. Swipe as many times and press down as firmly as needed. ● For really tougher grime, you can wet down the cooled stovetop and let the water soak in a few minutes before swiping. ● After swiping, simply wipe your stovetop with a damp cloth or paper towel. Be sure to keep the StoveRazor's edge clean! ● Pro Tip: for an extra shine that impresses guests, just polish with your favorite stove cleaning wipe or spray, afterward. Just remember to use only on the glass portions of your stove top and keep the edge of the StoveRazor clean for maximum effectiveness. The metal edge on the StoveRazor is no harder than the metal on pots and pans that your glass cooktop was designed to handle. The edge is also no sharper than a typical metal spatula, so there is no fear of cuts with safe handling. Clean with confidence. Clean with less chemicals. Clean with less time and effort. Let StoveRazor help keep your glass stovetop looking as tidy as the rest of your kitchen. Now you can focus on preparing food for the family or trying out new recipes without dreading cleanup. Remember to share this gift of easy cleanup with friends and family! At Piffny, we're out to make great products that help you live better, happier, and more conveniently.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qE1KDwm1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Piffny","source_asin":"B08X1TLRGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-323865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X1TLRGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X1TLRGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
