window.products.push({"id":323955,"name":"Petrilife Waterproof Sofa Cover High Stretch Sofa Slipcover Super Soft Armchair Cover with Anti Slip Foam Sticks Leak Proof Furniture Protector (Small","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sbl2KK35S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UPGRADED PROTECETION: The lightweight fabric made of upgraded water resistant material brings ultimate comfort to your home life. Our upgraded waterproof technology allows liquid to form water droplets on the surface of sofa slipcovers without making your furniture wet or dirty (not 100% waterproof, please wipe off the water droplets immediately). Keep your furniture from getting spilled, stained, torn in everyday life and look brand new for much longer time compared with other couch slipcovers. GREAT FIT: Petrilife sofa covers are made of form-fitting, super-stretchy, tear-resistant fabric that conform to the contours of your furniture for a perfect fit, just like a tailor-made. The elastic band sewn on the bottom of the couch cover can provide a strong grip on your sofa for a tight, customizable fit. In addition, there are foam rollers in the package that can stuff excess fabric into the gap of the sofa to help the sofa slipcovers fit more firmly without slipping away. AESTHETIC DECOR: This stylish designed sofa cover features a small checkered texture. Available in a variety of colors to match the changing seasons and a neutral, non-printed design to fit a variety of furniture styles and express your personality. Give your living room a fresh new look! These couch covers use unique environmentally friendly dyeing technology, which has high color fastness to keep the color unchanged after repeated washing. Save you money by extending the life of your sofa. DIMENSIONS: Please measure the length of your sofa before buying, from the armrest on one side of the sofa to the armrest on the other side. The dimensions of our sofa covers are divided as follows: The length of the Small size is 32-47 inches, the length of the Medium size is 57-70 inches, the length of the Large size is 72-92 inches, and the length of the X-Large size is 92-118 inches. The width and height of the four sizes are 32-42 inches and 31-41inches. EASY USE: You can effortlessly install this sofa slipcover by yourself to give your sofa a fresh look. Anti-slip FOAM RODS are included in the package, tucking them into the gaps to get perfect non-slip effect! Installation Guide of sofa slipcover is displayed in the product pictures andt packages, please follow our guide to install the slipcovers. If you have any questions, please don’t hesitate to contact us through Amazon and we will be pleased to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sbl2KK35S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Petrilife","source_asin":"B0B4WCGYCH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-323955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4WCGYCH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4WCGYCH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
